@startuml
autonumber
skinparam Monochrome true
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F9F9F9

actor Buyer
participant "System" as System
participant "Database" as DB

== Search, Browse & Selection ==
Buyer -> System: searches for or browses to desired listing
activate System

System -> DB: queryListings()
activate DB
DB --> System: returns matching Listings
deactivate DB

System --> Buyer: displays listing details
deactivate System

Buyer -> System: selects listing & chooses purchase/subscription option
activate System

== Availability Check (ALT2) ==
System -> DB: isAvailable() [on Listing]
activate DB
DB --> System: returns availability status
deactivate DB

alt ALT2: Listing is unavailable
    System --> Buyer: informs listing is unavailable & prevents completion
else Listing is available
    System --> Buyer: displays item, price, and order information
    deactivate System

    == Payment Verification & Review (ALT1) ==
    Buyer -> System: reviews order info & selects payment method
    activate System

    System -> DB: checkBuyerPaymentMethods()
    activate DB
    DB --> System: returns payment methods
    deactivate DB

    alt ALT1: Buyer does not have a valid payment method
        System --> Buyer: informs valid payment method is required
        deactivate System
        
        Buyer -> System: adds or selects valid payment method
        activate System
    end

    == Transaction Processing & Completion ==
    Buyer -> System: confirms purchase or subscription
    
    System -> DB: charge(amount) [on Payment]
    activate DB
    DB --> System: transaction success (returns true)
    deactivate DB

    System -> DB: checkout() / create Order & OrderItem
    activate DB
    DB --> System: order and items saved to account
    deactivate DB

    System --> Buyer: informs purchase/subscription was successful & added to order history
    deactivate System
end

@enduml